OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless census gives 84 women a
OL,4,A'vital voice'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA census that found 84 women had
OL,7,Fnowhere to stay during a three-month
OL,8,Fperiod has given them a "vital voice".
OL,10,FWest Northamptonshire Council said
OL,11,Fbetween July and September it found
OL,12,Fthey were either sleeping rough,
OL,13,Fstaying in unsafe or unstable
OL,14,Fenvironments, using places that were
OL,15,Fopen 24 hours a day, sleeping
OL,16,Ftemporarily with family, friends or
OL,17,Fstrangers, living in unsuitable
OL,18,Faccommodation or fleeing domestic
OL,19,Fabuse.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
