OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless census gives 84 women a
OL,4,A'vital voice'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen shared their experiences via
OL,7,Fin-depth surveys, which found they were
OL,8,Falso affected by sexual violence,
OL,9,Ftrauma, poor mental health and had had
OL,10,Finvolvement with the criminal justice
OL,11,Fsystem.
OL,13,FThe authority said the findings would
OL,14,Fshape the support it could give.
